Revision history for Mojolicious-Plugin-Buffer

0.001.1	Mon Nov  2 02:57:26 PM EST 2026
	[ Security ]
	- A response with Cache-Control: no-cache is no longer stored in the
		server-side cache, since replaying it skips the revalidation
		that no-cache requires
	- optimise_content: hostile HTML, such as long runs of white space,
		unterminated <title> or <a href=" tags and unclosed <pre>
		elements, took quadratic time and could hold a worker for
		minutes.  The squashing now runs in linear time
	[ Bug Fixes ]
	- optimise_content: a visible space between two inline elements was
		removed, e.g. "Hello <b>world</b>" became "Hello<b>world</b>"
	- optimise_content level 2: the <!-- hiding technique was looked for
		past the end of a <script> tag, so the text of a later HTML
		comment could be shown on the page
	- optimise_content level 2: document.write calls in a script of
		another type, such as a template, could be merged, and the
		script's type was changed to text/JavaScript
	[ Tests ]
	- Added .github/workflows/extra-ci.yml

0.001.0	Mon Oct 26 09:45:49 PM EDT 2026
	Initial version.
